# The repo-root .gitignore matches studies/*/*/<x> (two levels). The contrasts in
# this folder sit one level deeper (studies/fungi/yeast_convergence/<id>/), so the
# same class-1 (ephemeral, regenerable) rules are repeated here for them.
# Same reasons as the root file: never commit fetched data, materialized inputs,
# annotation extracts, enrichment caches or pipeline results.
*/data/
*/data_dir
*/data_dir_*
*/annotations/
*/annotations_orig/
*/results/
*/analysis/enrichment/outputs/cache/
*/analysis/pfam_hmmsearch/
# Cross-contrast comparison working files (the summary tables are tracked).
analysis/convergence/tmp/
# BUSCO per-proteome run directories (regenerable with bin/run_busco_proteomes.sh)
analysis/busco/runs/
analysis/convergence/term_recurrence.tsv
